    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Ox &amp; Horse Work in Hell&quot; players team up with their friends to take on the roles of Ox-Head and Horse-Face, the guardians of the underworld. Your daily work involves battling evil spirits, punishing them, and collecting Sin Points they drop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415340/extras/756abc097d02d51e2185cf853ce49d93.poster.avif?t=1754551064\" width=620 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415340/extras/756abc097d02d51e2185cf853ce49d93.webm?t=1754551064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415340/extras/756abc097d02d51e2185cf853ce49d93.mp4?t=1754551064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many ways to punish these evil spirits:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat them down directly with your fists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up items and smash them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tie up fallen ghosts on torture devices and vigorously torment them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize contraptions to create an assembly line of punishment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Incidental Encounters at Work</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your work in Hell will also involve interacting with various colleagues and superiors, leading to numerous interesting story snippets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415340/extras/4b7cdf9a0e3e985e982e1efd14fabd6e.poster.avif?t=1754551064\" width=620 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415340/extras/4b7cdf9a0e3e985e982e1efd14fabd6e.webm?t=1754551064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415340/extras/4b7cdf9a0e3e985e982e1efd14fabd6e.mp4?t=1754551064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interesting Work Nodes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break at Meng Po's shop, have some soup, and buy items and equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Report repairs or purchase new torture devices from the Judge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open treasure chests to claim free rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter unexpected events, such as being asked by a superior to run errands (maybe there's a reward?).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience some adult encounters with female ghosts or colleagues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have a brawl with colleagues to see who will be the outstanding employee of the day.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative and competitive two-player gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of punishment torture devices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large number of contraptions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous evil spirits descending into Hell.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Ox &amp; Horse Work in Hell&quot; players team up with their friends to take on the roles of Ox-Head and Horse-Face, the guardians of the underworld. Your daily work involves battling evil spirits, punishing them, and collecting Sin Points they drop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415340/extras/756abc097d02d51e2185cf853ce49d93.poster.avif?t=1754551064\" width=620 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415340/extras/756abc097d02d51e2185cf853ce49d93.webm?t=1754551064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415340/extras/756abc097d02d51e2185cf853ce49d93.mp4?t=1754551064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many ways to punish these evil spirits:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat them down directly with your fists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up items and smash them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tie up fallen ghosts on torture devices and vigorously torment them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize contraptions to create an assembly line of punishment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Incidental Encounters at Work</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your work in Hell will also involve interacting with various colleagues and superiors, leading to numerous interesting story snippets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415340/extras/4b7cdf9a0e3e985e982e1efd14fabd6e.poster.avif?t=1754551064\" width=620 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415340/extras/4b7cdf9a0e3e985e982e1efd14fabd6e.webm?t=1754551064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415340/extras/4b7cdf9a0e3e985e982e1efd14fabd6e.mp4?t=1754551064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interesting Work Nodes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break at Meng Po's shop, have some soup, and buy items and equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Report repairs or purchase new torture devices from the Judge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open treasure chests to claim free rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter unexpected events, such as being asked by a superior to run errands (maybe there's a reward?).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience some adult encounters with female ghosts or colleagues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have a brawl with colleagues to see who will be the outstanding employee of the day.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative and competitive two-player gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of punishment torture devices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large number of contraptions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous evil spirits descending into Hell.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "\u201cOx &amp; Horse Work in Hell\u201d is a 2-player co-op combat roguelike. Control Ox-Head and Horse-Face to punish rogue ghosts, but beware\u2014their varied powers make them no easy targets.",
